{
  "dom_id": "step-8762",
  "name": "Example: \n                    Using Vertical Angles in a Situation With Three Lines",
  "problem": "In the diagram shown below, it is known that $m \\angle 1 = 60^\\circ$ and $m \\angle 3 = 120^\\circ.$ Determine the value of $m \\angle 2 + m \\angle 4.$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14173512/assets/1bc662904a52724fac28dc180f70088592ff4da181930c6607b1bb590b3ec188.png)",
  "worked_solution": "We have two pairs of vertical angles, and we know that vertical angles are congruent and therefore have the same measure. So, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}m∠1=m∠2, \\\\ m∠3=m∠4.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe are told that $m \\angle 1 = 60^\\circ$ and $m \\angle 3 = 120^\\circ,$ so we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{60}^{∘}=m∠2, \\\\ {120}^{∘}=m∠4.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, we obtain \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}m∠2+m∠4 & ={60}^{∘}+{120}^{∘} \\\\  & ={180}^{∘}.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-8762\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"8762\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"2587\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-8762\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-11\">Using Vertical Angles in a Situation With Three Lines</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"8762\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                            margin: 0\n                 